---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Manage secret values (stored in the OS keychain, never in workspace files)

Usage: rustman secret [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  set             Store a secret's value (prompted without echo, or read from stdin)
  rm              Delete a secret's stored value
  list            List declared secrets and whether a value is stored (values are never shown)
  get             Fetch a secret reference from its provider and show it masked
  test            Check that secret providers can authenticate and be reached
  list-providers  List the configured secret providers (never values)
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
